# Environment variables for the arcade_ynab MCP server.
#
# This server needs no secrets: every tool authenticates to YNAB with the calling
# user's OAuth token, which Arcade injects at runtime (see docs/SPEC.md).
#
# Don't put a YNAB personal access token here or in `arcade secret`: nothing reads it.
# The OAuth client secret belongs in the Arcade OAuth provider `ynab`, not in a file.
# See docs/DEPLOYMENT.md to verify a deployment's credentials.
#
# Copy to .env only if you need local overrides. Never commit .env.
